{
  "id": "wf-p6-cluster",
  "title": "K-means clustering of three blobs with per-row silhouette",
  "rationale": "Pins dap.cluster end to end: k-means++ on three well separated blobs, the cluster label and the silhouette column, plus a group_by count proving each blob forms one cluster of ten rows.",
  "kind": "native",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "blobs",
      "type": "csv_reader",
      "config": {
        "dataset": "CLUSTER_BLOBS"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cluster",
      "type": "cluster",
      "config": {
        "columns": [
          "x",
          "y"
        ],
        "method": "kmeans",
        "k": 3,
        "standardize": false,
        "seed": 42
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "counts",
      "type": "group_by",
      "config": {
        "keys": [
          "cluster"
        ],
        "aggregations": [
          {
            "column": "id",
            "fn": "count"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "blobs",
      "to": "cluster"
    },
    {
      "from": "cluster",
      "to": "counts"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "node": "cluster",
      "kind": "expect",
      "rows": 30,
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "type": "Number (Integer)"
        },
        {
          "name": "x",
          "type": "Number (Float)"
        },
        {
          "name": "y",
          "type": "Number (Float)"
        },
        {
          "name": "cluster",
          "type": "Number (Integer)"
        },
        {
          "name": "silhouette",
          "type": "Number (Float)",
          "min": 0.9701782157321818,
          "max": 0.9838439152598573,
          "mean": 0.9785995532153952
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "node": "counts",
      "kind": "expect",
      "rows": 3,
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "cluster",
          "type": "Number (Integer)"
        },
        {
          "name": "Count(id)",
          "type": "Number (Integer)"
        }
      ],
      "data": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ],
        [
          1,
          10
        ],
        [
          2,
          10
        ]
      ],
      "order": "unordered"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Fixture: three blobs of ten points around (0,0), (10,0) and (0,10). Silhouette expectations computed independently in Python on the blob labels: a = mean distance to the same blob (self excluded), b = smallest mean distance to another blob, s = (b - a) / max(a, b). K-means++ with seed 42 and standardize=false assigns exactly one blob per cluster; the label numbering is arbitrary, so only the per-cluster counts (10 each) and the permutation-invariant silhouette statistics are pinned."
}
